#: checks/authenticators.py:54
msgid ""
"Asks every authenticator that knows how to assess itself for problems. Today "
"that covers SAML, which reports signing certificates of the IdP that have "
"expired, expire within 30 days or cannot be read. The details list every "
"problem found, worst first."
msgstr ""
"Arazoak nola ebaluatu dakien autentifikatzaile orori galdetzen dio. Gaur "
"egun, SAML barne hartzen du, eta honek iraungi diren, 30 eguneko epean "
"iraungitzen diren edo irakurri ezin diren IdP-aren sinadura-ziurtagiriak "
"jakinarazten ditu. Xehetasunek aurkitutako arazo guztiak zerrendatzen "
"dituzte, txarrenetik hasita."

#: checks/authenticators.py:85
msgid "All authenticators that can assess themselves report no problems."
msgstr ""
"Beren burua ebaluatu dezaketen autentifikatzaile guztiek ez dute arazorik "
"jakinarazi."

#: checks/cluster.py:105
msgid ""
"Compares the timezone reported by every recently seen cluster node. Mixed "
"timezones make each node interpret a naive database clock (MySQL) as a "
"different instant, so the same job can be seen as due on one node and not on "
"another. Align the server timezone (timedatectl) on every node."
msgstr ""
"Kluster nodo bakoitzak duela gutxi ikusitako ordu-zona alderatzen du. Ordu-"
"zona mistoek nodo bakoitzak datu-baseko erloju naif bat (MySQL) une "
"desberdin gisa interpretatzea eragiten dute, beraz, lan bera nodo batean "
"egin behar dela ikus daiteke eta ez beste batean. Lerrokatu zerbitzariaren "
"ordu-zona (timedatectl) nodo guztietan."

#: checks/cluster.py:117
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cluster has {count} fresh node(s), no timezone comparison possible."
msgstr "Klusterrak du {count} nodo freskoak, ezinezkoa da ordu-zona alderatzea."

#: checks/cluster.py:130
#, python-brace-format
msgid "All {count} fresh cluster nodes use the same timezone ({tz})."
msgstr ""
"Guztiak {count} Kluster nodo berriek ordu-zona bera erabiltzen dute ({tz})."

#: checks/cluster.py:140
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Fresh cluster nodes use different timezones: {summary}. A naive database "
"clock is interpreted on each node using its own timezone, so nodes disagree "
"on what time it is."
msgstr ""
"Kluster nodo berriek ordu-zona desberdinak erabiltzen dituzte: {summary}. "
"Datu-baseko erloju inozo bat nodo bakoitzean bere ordu-zona erabiliz "
"interpretatzen da, beraz, nodoek ez dute ados jartzen zer ordu den."

#: checks/cluster.py:153
msgid ""
"Compares the local clock of every recently seen cluster node against the "
"database clock. Scheduling always uses the database clock, but the local "
"clock stamps rows, tokens and logs, so a drifted node is usually a NTP "
"problem worth fixing. Check the details for the drifted nodes."
msgstr ""
"Duela gutxi ikusitako kluster nodo bakoitzaren tokiko erlojua datu-baseko "
"erlojuarekin alderatzen du. Programazioak beti erabiltzen du datu-baseko "
"erlojua, baina tokiko erlojuak errenkadak, tokenak eta erregistroak "
"zigilatzen ditu, beraz, nodo desbideratu bat normalean konpontzea merezi "
"duen NTP arazoa da. Begiratu nodo desbideratuen xehetasunak."

#: checks/cluster.py:166
msgid "No fresh cluster node found, no clock drift comparison possible."
msgstr ""
"Ez da kluster nodo berririk aurkitu, ez da erloju-desbiderapenaren "
"konparaketa posible."

#: checks/cluster.py:181
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{count} cluster node(s) have a local clock drifted more than {threshold}s "
"from the database clock: {examples}. Fix the time synchronization (NTP) on "
"those nodes."
msgstr ""
"{count} kluster nodoek erloju lokala baino gehiago aldatu dute {threshold}s "
"datu-baseko erlojutik: {examples}. Konpondu nodo horien denbora-"
"sinkronizazioa (NTP)."

#: checks/cluster.py:189
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"All {count} fresh cluster node(s) are within {threshold}s of the database "
"clock."
msgstr ""
"Guztiak {count} Kluster nodo berriak barruan daude {threshold}Datu-baseko "
"erlojuaren"

#: checks/cluster.py:201
msgid ""
"Reads the raw database clock several times through consecutive connections "
"and measures the spread. Behind a load balanced database cluster, a big "
"spread means the database nodes themselves are not time synchronized, which "
"breaks every scheduling decision. Fix NTP on the database servers."
msgstr ""
"Datu-basearen erloju gordina hainbat aldiz irakurtzen du konexio jarraien "
"bidez eta hedapena neurtzen du. Karga orekatutako datu-base kluster baten "
"atzean, hedapen handi batek esan nahi du datu-basearen nodoak berak ez "
"daudela denboran sinkronizatuta, eta horrek programazio erabaki guztiak "
"hausten ditu. Konpondu NTP datu-base zerbitzarietan."

#: checks/cluster.py:214
msgid ""
"Could not take enough database clock samples, no spread comparison possible."
msgstr ""
"Ezin izan dira datu-baseko erloju-lagin nahikorik hartu, ez da posible "
"hedapen-konparaketa."

#: checks/cluster.py:223
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Database clock spread across {count} samples is {spread:.2f}s, above the "
"{threshold}s threshold. The database nodes are probably not time "
"synchronized."
msgstr ""
"Datu-basearen erlojua sakabanatuta {count} laginak dira {spread:.2f}s, "
"gainetik {threshold}s atalasea. Datu-baseko nodoak ziurrenik ez daude "
"denborarekin sinkronizatuta."

#: checks/cluster.py:230
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Database clock spread across {count} samples is {spread:.2f}s, within limits."
msgstr ""
"Datu-basearen erlojua zabalduta {count} laginak dira {spread:.2f}s, muga "
"batzuen barruan."

#: checks/deferred_deletion.py:62
msgid ""
"Looks for machines that have been waiting in the deferred deletion queues "
"for longer than MAX_DEFERRED_DELETION_TIME. It usually means the platform is "
"failing to stop or delete them. Check the provider; the details list every "
"stuck machine."
msgstr ""
"MAX_DEFERRED_DELETION_TIME baino denbora gehiagoz ezabatze atzeratuaren "
"ilaran zain egon diren makinak bilatzen ditu. Normalean plataformak huts "
"egiten ari dela esan nahi du gelditzeko edo ezabatzeko. Egiaztatu "
"hornitzailea; xehetasunek trabatuta dauden makina guztiak zerrendatzen "
"dituzte."

#: checks/deferred_deletion.py:89
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Deferred deletion queues hold {total} element(s); {stuck} of them older than "
"{hours}h: {examples}. The target platform is probably failing to stop or "
"delete machines."
msgstr ""
"Atzeratutako ezabatze-ilaretan eusten da {total} elementu(ak); {stuck} "
"haietatik zaharragoak baino {hours}h: {examples}. Helburuko plataformak "
"ziurrenik huts egiten ari da makinak gelditzeko edo ezabatzeko."

#: checks/deferred_deletion.py:100
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Deferred deletion queues are within limits ({total} element(s), none older "
"than {hours}h)."
msgstr ""
"Atzeratutako ezabatze-ilarak mugaren barruan daude ({total} elementu(ak), "
"bat ere ez zaharragoa {hours}h)."

#: checks/global_config.py:55
msgid ""
"Verifies that the superuser (root) password is not the default one. A known "
"password gives full administration access. Change SUPER_USER_PASS in the "
